  "segments": [
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Nastya accidentally broke Chef Barinov's side mirror. Outside the restaurant, the owner Eleonora points out the damage to Barinov. Believing she did it, he takes revenge. We will hear it in Russian first; don't worry about catching every word.",
      "gap": 0.8
    },
    {
      "v": "eleonora",
      "t": "Виктор Петрович, у вас тут зеркало сломанное.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "barinov",
      "t": "Да надо же!",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "barinov",
      "t": "А вы не заметили?",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "barinov",
      "t": "Что у вас тоже?",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "eleonora",
      "t": "У меня? Как? Где?",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "barinov",
      "t": "Ну вот же.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "barinov",
      "t": "Теперь мы квиты.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "nastya",
      "t": "Костя, ты видел?",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "nastya",
      "t": "Он разбивает зеркало её машины.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "nastya",
      "t": "А она типа не при делах.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "nastya",
      "t": "Я уверена.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "nastya",
      "t": "Это просто так не закончится.",
      "gap": 0.9
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Now let's go back through the conversation line by line.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "eleonora",
      "t": "Виктор Петрович, у вас тут зеркало сломанное.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Viktor Petrovich, you have a broken mirror here.' Eleonora points out the damage. She uses the classic Russian way of saying 'you have' by literally saying 'at you'.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "barinov",
      "t": "Да надо же!",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Well, would you look at that!' Chef Barinov feigns surprise. He acts like he had no idea it was broken.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "barinov",
      "t": "А вы не заметили?",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Didn't you notice?' He turns the situation around on her. Barinov asks if she saw anything suspicious.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "barinov",
      "t": "Что у вас тоже?",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'That yours is too?' Chef Barinov gestures to her car. He suggests her mirror might have met a similar fate.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "eleonora",
      "t": "У меня? Как? Где?",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Mine? How? Where?' Eleonora is totally confused. She has no idea what he is talking about.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "barinov",
      "t": "Ну вот же.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Right there.' He points to the broken mirror he just smashed. Barinov proudly displays his revenge.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "barinov",
      "t": "Теперь мы квиты.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Now we're even.' Chef Barinov declares them equal. He feels justice has been served.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "nastya",
      "t": "Костя, ты видел?",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Kostya, did you see?' Nastya is shocked by what she just witnessed. She checks if Kostya saw it too.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "nastya",
      "t": "Он разбивает зеркало её машины.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'He smashes the mirror on her car.' She describes the vandalism in plain terms. Nastya cannot believe the Chef actually did it.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "nastya",
      "t": "А она типа не при делах.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'And she acts like she had nothing to do with it.' Nastya notes Eleonora's confusion. The owner clearly has no clue why this is happening.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "nastya",
      "t": "Я уверена.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'I am sure.' Nastya is absolutely certain about the consequences. She knows this will escalate.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "nastya",
      "t": "Это просто так не закончится.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'This won't just blow over.' She knows the Chef's temper. Nastya predicts this feud is far from over. Now let's listen to the whole conversation again from start to finish.",
      "gap": 0.9
    },
    {
      "v": "eleonora",
      "t": "Виктор Петрович, у вас тут зеркало сломанное.",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "barinov",
      "t": "Да надо же!",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
