      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "nastya",
      "t": "Это просто так не закончится.",
      "gap": 0.9
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "That's it for this scene! The broken mirror will cause more trouble soon. Next time you watch the episode, listen for the Russian expressions for 'mirror' and 'broken' — you will catch every word right away. See you next time!",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "nastya",
      "t": "Пока!",
      "gap": 0.3
    }
